One file is not: docs/random-wire.html is GPL-3.0-or-later, because it
loads nec2c-wasm to check a length against NEC and nec2c carries Neoklis
Kyriazis's GPL.  Its own header carries the notice.  Nothing else in the
repository links against it, and nec/random_wire/ stays MIT because it
imports PyNEC as a dependency rather than shipping it.

